---
title: Web Application
order: 7
---

Barque includes a local web app for managing projects, captures, and usage.

## Open the app

After starting the container, visit: `http://localhost:3000`

## Home

- View all projects and search by name.
- Add a new project from the drawer.

## Captures

Inside a project you can:

- Add captures from a website URL, plain text, or JSON data.
- Search captures.
- Select and delete captures in bulk.

## Usage

The Usage page shows recent queries and the captures used to answer them.

## Settings

- Global settings let you change the UI theme.
- Project settings let you rename or delete a project (including all captures).
